itle":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Romance","Music"],"id":20260,"type":"SERIES","title":"Love Song","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk42/seasons/4961f10c-a7d7-4e9a-a33f-0e4b78fb87e8.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk49/seasons/d911fbcd-407f-46c7-8bbf-468ed9a77994.jpg","likes":22,"dislikes":0,"views":2762,"release_date":"1460332800000","season_number":1,"description":"Kohei Kamishiro (Masaharu Fukuyama) worked as a musician in his past. He only had one hit song and his recording contract was eventually cancelled. He became devastated and left the field of music.\r\n\r\nTwenty years later, Kohei Kamishiro keeps his distance from music, but his passion for music hasn't faded away. He leads a boring life. Due to his past experience, he finds it difficult to have a relationship with women. Oneday, a woman appears in front of him. She has a complex and because of this leads a solitary life. The woman though has an amazing singing voice. By meeting her, Kohei begins to think he wants to make music again.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.5}],"value":6.5,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":9179,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}